08/931595103879827456012974.png/wP15YVlAxajEFymdA2RSwwfPd9W5MLZRFVJ-JxVSfic\"/><figcaption>一杯酒看穿日本文化　日本人為什麼愛喝酒？是社交還是為舒壓？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一杯酒看穿日本文化　日本人為什麼愛喝酒？是社交還是為舒壓？（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241108/931595106056802304963281.png/nVNkypsbc5sRwtVBZR1l7GVwq4m545i4vnzRE7580RM\"/><figcaption>一杯酒看穿日本文化　日本人為什麼愛喝酒？是社交還是為舒壓？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一杯酒看穿日本文化　日本人為什麼愛喝酒？是社交還是為舒壓？（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241108/931595108074393600302467.png/r9NYmuxcmTYFNFBAEQN5KxPPpJ8jQqKgWduy11nbstc\"/><figcaption>一杯酒看穿日本文化　日本人為什麼愛喝酒？是社交還是為舒壓？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文獲「Japaholic」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-02T12:20:12.035359+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1708,"images":22,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}